{"year":"2022","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 27th edition was held on March 13, 2022, with simultaneous ceremonies at the Fairmont Century Plaza in Los Angeles and the Savoy Hotel in London. Originally scheduled for January 9, it was postponed because of the wave of the COVID-19 Omicron variant. Hosted by <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 17637, 'screen_type': person}\">Taye Diggs</a> and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1381399, 'screen_type': person}\">Nicole Byer</a>, it was broadcast by The CW and TBS. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 777270, 'screen_type': movie}\">Belfast</a> and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 511809, 'screen_type': movie}\">West Side Story</a> led the nominations, with 11 each, but <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 600583, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Power of the Dog</a> was the most awarded, with four trophies, including Best Picture and Best Director for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 10757, 'screen_type': person}\">Jane Campion</a>.<br/><br/>*<i>Television awards are not included</i>."},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":600583,"name":"The Power of the Dog","image_path":"/rgDJDLFKOKF0dpbaVwgbvjbyZgM.jpg","director":"Jane Campion","winner":true,"backdrop_path":"/gAsHuCQMN7mv4uFIvM4ACQ09hPr.jpg"},{"type":"movie","id":777270,"name":"Belfast","image_path":"/3mInLZyPOVLsZRsBwNHi3UJXXnm.jpg","director":"Kenneth Branagh","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":776503,"name":"CODA","image_path":"/fXeWSHLlAEsINva6SJgb5hCLBzy.jpg","director":"Sian Heder","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":646380,"name":"Don't Look Up","image_path":"/6Sc7Tjt7aPsdghYK32mDMFeZkqJ.jpg","director":"Adam McKay","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":438631,"name":"Dune","image_path":"/uzERcfV2rSHNhW5eViQiO9hNiA7.jpg","director":"Denis Villeneuve","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":614917,"name":"King Richard","image_path":"/KUdG6W99PfHe3wzuBWgfsHUuM.jpg